---

## 📊 Sales vs. Purchases — FY 2025-26 (Apr 2025 – Mar 2026)

> All figures are **base values (excl. GST)** as recorded in Tally ledgers. Sales recorded under party ledgers; Purchases under **Purchase Account**.

---

### 🔢 Annual Summary

| Metric | Amount |
|---|---|
| **Total Sales** | ₹2,04,500.00 |
| **Total Purchases** | ₹4,85,450.00 |
| **Difference (Sales − Purchases)** | **−₹2,80,950.00** |
| **Sales as % of Purchases** | **42.1%** |

Purchases exceed Sales by **₹2,80,950.00 (−57.9%)** for the full year — a significant imbalance suggesting the business is in a heavy stocking/procurement phase with limited sales activity so far.

---

### 📅 Month-by-Month Comparison

| Month | Sales (FY 2025-26) | Purchases (FY 2025-26) | Surplus / (Deficit) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Apr 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹1,17,500.00 | ₹1,17,500.00 |
| May 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹18,750.00 | ₹18,750.00 |
| Jun 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹96,000.00 | ₹96,000.00 |
| Jul 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹12,300.00 | ₹12,300.00 |
| Aug 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹8,900.00 | ₹8,900.00 |
| Sep 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹54,000.00 | ₹54,000.00 |
| Oct 2025 | ₹2,04,500.00 | ₹0.00 | −₹2,04,500.00 |
| Nov 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹1,35,000.00 | ₹1,35,000.00 |
| Dec 2025 | ₹0.00 | ₹27,600.00 | ₹27,600.00 |
| Jan 2026 | ₹0.00 | ₹15,400.00 | ₹15,400.00 |
| Feb 2026 | ₹0.00 | ₹0.00 | ₹0.00 |
| Mar 2026 | ₹0.00 | ₹0.00 | ₹0.00 |
| **Total** | **₹2,04,500.00** | **₹4,85,450.00** | **−₹2,80,950.00** |

> ⚠️ **Data gaps noted:**
> - **Sales**: Only **2 vouchers** recorded, both in **Oct 2025** (S001 & S002). No sales activity was found for Apr–Sep 2025, Nov 2025 – Mar 2026.
> - **Purchases**: Recorded across **10 months** (Apr 2025 – Jan 2026). **No purchase transactions** for Feb 2026 and Mar 2026.

---

### 🏷️ Purchase Breakdown by Vendor

