| P003 | May 2025 | Digital World Components | ₹18,750.00 |
| P004 | Jun 2025 | Rajesh Electronics Wholesale | ₹96,000.00 |
| P005 | Jul 2025 | TechnoVision Electronics | ₹12,300.00 |
| P006 | Aug 2025 | Supreme Office Supplies | ₹8,900.00 |
| P007 | Sep 2025 | Digital World Components | ₹54,000.00 |
