| S002 | Oct 2025 | Sunrise Electronics Mumbai | ₹1,10,500.00 |

---

## 💡 Key Insights

- **Purchases (₹4,85,450) dwarf Sales (₹2,04,500)** — purchases are 2.37× higher than sales for FY 2025-26, indicating heavy inventory procurement with very limited revenue realisation so far.
- **Sales are concentrated in a single month (Oct 2025)** — only 2 invoices across the entire year, which is unusually low and may suggest either a business in early operations or missing voucher entries for other months.
- **No transactions at all in Feb 2026 & Mar 2026** — both sales and purchase ledgers show zero activity in the final two months of the fiscal year; this warrants verification in Tally.
- **Largest purchase month is Nov 2025 (₹1,35,000)** — driven by a single bulk laptop batch order (P008) from Rajesh Electronics Wholesale, making it the peak procurement period.
- **Gross margin cannot be computed meaningfully** — with purchases spread across 10 months but sales only in 1 month, matching cost-of-goods-sold to revenue is not possible without inventory/stock ledger data.

